      "id": "promo-unlocked",
      "mechanism": "write-readback",
      "description": "升職（草稿月份）：同一組員工與月份名冊，舊版 /api/employee-movements/batch 與新版 movement-submit 寫入後，回讀異動歷史與每月人員狀態。主檔職位：舊版 DEV 沒有同步（B.3）；新版同步為最新有效升職。月結頁新增近期因異動自動調整紀錄（A.3）。",
      "legacy": {
        "api": {
          "path": "/api/employee-movements/batch",
          "method": "POST"
        }
      },
      "native": {
        "api": {
          "path": "/api/workspace/movement-submit",
          "method": "POST"
        }
      }
    },
    {
